  "yzt_super.msg.book_p1": "Step 1: Log in\nClick the green chat button\n\"▶ Click to log in\", type your\npassword in the anvil box, then\nclick the right result slot to submit.\nEsc cancels.\n\nOr type:\n/yzts login <password>",
  "yzt_super.msg.book_p2": "Step 2: Register\nFirst time here? Click the green\nbutton \"▶ Click to register\", type\na password, then click the right\nresult slot to submit.\n\nOr type:\n/yzts register <password>",
  "yzt_super.msg.book_p3": "Forgot your password?\nAsk an admin to reset it.\nYou can also reserve an email with\n/yzts account email.",
  "yzt_super.msg.book_p4": "More features\nTitle: type /yzts title to open the title picker,\nor click \"Choose Title\" in Account settings.\n\nMail: type /yzts mail send to write a letter,\n/yzts mail board to view the public board.\n\nShout: type /yzts shout for a server-wide shout.",
